# The Claude Code skill mirror (.claude/skills) is NOT ignored. A symlinked mirror is 17 bytes and
# makes a fresh clone work immediately; a copy-fallback mirror is caught by
# `npm run guard -- --only=agents` if it ever diverges. That guard is the reason committing it is safe.
